title: Development
---
body:

<section>
  <h2>Source Code</h2>

  <h3>Repository</h3>
  <div class="buttons">
    <a href="https://github.com/cinemagoer/cinemagoer" class="button secondary">GitHub Repo</a>
  </div>

  <h3>Bugs</h3>
  <div class="buttons">
    <p><a href="https://github.com/cinemagoer/cinemagoer/issues" class="button secondary">Issue Tracker</a></p>
  </div>

  <p>Before filing any new issue, please check if it has been already reported.</p>
  <p>Please report every information needed to reproduce the error. Remember to include:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>error messages</li>
    <li>stack tracebacks</li>
    <li>URL (or name, or title) of the movie/person page that generates the error (if available)</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Patches</h3>
  <div class="buttons">
    <p><a href="https://github.com/cinemagoer/cinemagoer/pulls" class="button secondary">Pull Requests</a></p>
  </div>
</section>


